            "review_title": "Review at Tam Vi Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Trang H\n1 contribution\n0\nTop vegetarian restaurants worth trying in Vietnam.\nOct 2024 • Friends\nI really enjoyed it! This restaurant is not just a place to enjoy vegetarian food, but a journey to discover new flavors while still maintaining sophistication and elegance. Of course, good quality means a slightly higher price. But I love the feeling of eating without worrying about quality or calories, because all the dishes are very healthy but delicious. Every dish has eye-catching colors and brings freshness, like a dish that nourishes both the body and the soul. I will come here again when I have the opportunity to travel to Vietnam.\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
